  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0A88",
   "src": "521b627d8f3e",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¡Tranquilo!<NL><WAIT><FACE:07>Tengo mis «MiraMira»<NL>que pedí por catálogo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0AB5",
   "src": "046ed180ea96",
   "t": "<FACE:01>No te fíes de esas<NL>cosas, por favor…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0ACC",
   "src": "9bbb3bab701d",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¿Qué pasa, Hiyori?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0AD9",
   "src": "9b555b071583",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¡Silencio!<NL><WAIT>¿No escuchan algo?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0AF3",
   "src": "8ffdea0a7cf2",
   "t": "<FACE:59>¡Aaayudaaa-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0AFF",
   "src": "85df66fa06f1",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿Alguien pide ayuda?<WAIT><FACE:05>Suena algo raro, ¿no?<WAIT><FACE:00>¡Vamos a ver!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0B38",
   "src": "8915490dc4a9",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¿Qué es eso?<WAIT><FACE:04>…Ni idea…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0B4A",
   "src": "252a1b94ff34",
   "t": "<FACE:81>¡Me da miedo bajar<NL>más de aquí-robo!<WAIT>¡Ayúdenme-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0B6E",
   "src": "277a36fc085a",
   "t": "<FACE:05>¿Robo? ¿Qué es eso?<WAIT><FACE:00>¿Estará de moda?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0B8B",
   "src": "9cd9daf5d164",
   "t": "<FACE:7E>¡Pedí ayuda y nadie<NL>me ayuda-robo!<WAIT>¡Ya no importa-robo!<NL><WAIT>¡Que a esa gente mala<NL>le vaya muy mal-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0BD3",
   "src": "14c9fff3bac7",
   "t": "<FACE:7D>Robo robo, robo robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0BDF",
   "src": "aa5ed8363375",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¿¡Qué!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0BE7",
   "src": "45b1efb20ab3",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¿Quiénes son ustedes?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0BF4",
   "src": "b0764a25f11b",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¿Qué está pasando…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0C05",
   "src": "b918d75beed4",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>¡Yo soy Nyuudou, Jefe<NL>de Montaña de la<WAIT>Banda Space Robo Robo!<WAIT><FACE:04>¿¡Banda Space Robo<NL>Robo!?<WAIT><FACE:6C>Para abreviar, la<NL>Banda Sperobo<WAIT>¡El grupo malvado que<NL>domina el universo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0C68",
   "src": "d27737bb005b",
   "t": "<FACE:01>Nunca escuché de eso"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0C7B",
   "src": "c31e39f5356c",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>¡Es natural!<NL><WAIT>Nosotros actuamos<NL>allá en el espacio<WAIT>Los humanos de la<NL>Tierra no nos conocen"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0CC5",
   "src": "95b64544b0a1",
   "t": "<FACE:03>¿¡Y de eso presumes!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0CD7",
   "src": "7bd0ca1bc40b",
   "t": "<FACE:6D>¡Silencio!<WAIT><FACE:01>¿Qué quiere esa Banda<NL>Sperobo de nosotros?<WAIT>¡Suelta a Hiyori!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0D0D",
   "src": "2196e7934226",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>Nuestro objetivo es<NL>dominar el universo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0D2C",
   "src": "8d7034a1468b",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>Primero tomaremos<NL>este Cluster entero"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0D4A",
   "src": "01878f9b9e26",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>Parece que aquí solo<NL>quedaron niños<WAIT>Los niños sirven de<NL>mano de obra<WAIT>Nos los llevaremos<NL>para que nos sirvan"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0D9E",
   "src": "ca9cb22c6e71",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¿¡Ustedes mandaron el<NL>Cluster a la deriva!?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0DBF",
   "src": "1d855e12831a",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡Qué barbaridad!<WAIT><FACE:06>¡¿Quién obedecería a<NL>unos malvados así?!<WAIT><FACE:6C>¡Hacerse el valiente<NL>no sirve!<WAIT>¡Con la niña de rehén<NL>no puedes hacer nada!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0E29",
   "src": "31429cd4d10c",
   "t": "<FACE:01>Grr…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0E2E",
   "src": "973567d83bc3",
   "t": "<FACE:6C>¡Vamos!<NL>¡Ríndete tú también!<WAIT>¡Ustedes, andando!<WAIT><FACE:7D>Robo robo, robo robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0E64",
   "src": "4055291edb1e",
   "t": "<FACE:01>(¿Nada que hacer…?)"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0E74",
   "src": "1520ae6b8a8e",
   "t": "<FACE:14>¡Oye, viejo!<NL>¡Te olvidaste de uno!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0E90",
   "src": "3cdb541097d6",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡Ayyy… robooo…!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0E9C",
   "src": "e7f1925e6b65",
   "t": "<FACE:14>Por acá ya terminamos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0EAA",
   "src": "07bf2d5b686d",
   "t": "<FACE:80>¡Aaah-robo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0EB3",
   "src": "3dbb9b0eba23",
   "t": "<FACE:19>¡Acá también terminé!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0EC5",
   "src": "b71488d3b3a8",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Ya estamos parejos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0ED0",
   "src": "8a14f11ba166",
   "t": "<FACE:02>¡Chicos!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0ED7",
   "src": "900b2f18ee68",
   "t": "<FACE:6D>¡Ugh! ¡Unos niños tan<NL>insolentes!<WAIT>¡Conocerán el poder<NL>de Nyuudou!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0F0F",
   "src": "9734504176b0",
   "t": "<FACE:01>¡Toma eso!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0F16",
   "src": "b163d4537184",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Nos subestimaste por<NL>ser niños"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0F2E",
   "src": "8892c7c115fa",
   "t": "<FACE:0B>¿Y cómo piensas pagar<NL>por todo esto?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0F49",
   "src": "1b721f952b8d",
   "t": "<FACE:6D>¡Uuuuuuuuuuuuugh!<NL><WAIT>¡Retirada!<WAIT><FACE:7D>Robo robo, robo robo"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0F75",
   "src": "9a4aeb327ba2",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Vaya, vaya…<WAIT><FACE:05>¡¿Pero qué fue eso?!<NL><WAIT>¡¿Qué hacen tipos así<NL>dentro del Cluster?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0FA5",
   "src": "892b9c4e6939",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Da igual<NL><WAIT>Al que estorbe,<NL>lo hacemos pedazos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0FC8",
   "src": "6155c87fc49a",
   "t": "<FACE:19>¡Así se habla, líder!<WAIT><FACE:15>¡Lo seguimos hasta<NL>donde sea!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:0FE9",
   "src": "cdecb2ceee16",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Pero unos torpes así…<NL><WAIT>¿En serio mandaron el<NL>Cluster a la deriva?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:1029",
   "src": "56a473c792e0",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Bueno, por acá ya<NL>estamos tranquilos<WAIT><FACE:04>Sí…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:1045",
   "src": "0eec4e49cd24",
   "t": "<FACE:59>Help…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:104E",
   "src": "f3d4f72cbad0",
   "t": "<FACE:4F>Help… help me…<WAIT><FACE:00>Espera, ya te<NL>desato"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:1072",
   "src": "9fab872fbccf",
   "t": "<FACE:50>¡Sorry! ¡Creí morir!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:1085",
   "src": "85420ac538c9",
   "t": "<FACE:52>¡Oh, thank you!<NL>¡Nos salvaste!<WAIT><FACE:50>No creer que en Japón<NL>pasarnos esto…<WAIT><FACE:51>¡Thank you, salvador<NL>de mi vida!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:10C9",
   "src": "e1181f14199d",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Ggg… me ahogooo…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:10D7",
   "src": "43bd9ff3c56f",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Si no quieren que su<NL>salvador se desmaye…<WAIT>¿podrían soltarlo ya?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:1107",
   "src": "7b489852f917",
   "t": "<FACE:51>¡Sorry! Yo apretar<NL>de más…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:111B",
   "src": "683a7cb6ae80",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Cof cof, cof cof…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:1127",
   "src": "15850ec18718",
   "t": "<FACE:4F>Je, mi sister tener<NL>fuerza bruta, cuidado"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:1145",
   "src": "e6c93060e9e2",
   "t": "<FACE:03>Si ya lo sabías…<NL><WAIT>deténla, por favor…<WAIT><FACE:50>¡Hasta pagar la deuda<NL>yo ir contigo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:11A5",
   "src": "93cc59166219",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Este bloque…<NL>algo me inquieta…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:11BB",
   "src": "338ad2c47531",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡Hmpf!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:11C2",
   "src": "fdeecc5ebbdb",
   "t": "<FACE:06>¡¡Me adelanto!!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0068:11D0",
   "src": "967d973c2d82",
